 "fragmentos": {
  "relacionados": "<section class=\"secao relacionados\" aria-labelledby=\"rel-tit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <h2 id=\"rel-tit\" class=\"rv\">Precisa de ajuda com algum desses temas?</h2>\n    <ul class=\"rel-lista\"><li class=\"rv\"><a href=\"/servicos/contabilidade-completa/\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H20v15H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 20.5z\"/><path d=\"M4 20.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 6.5 23H20v-5\"/><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h6\"/></svg><span><b>Contabilidade completa</b><small>Balanço, DRE, impostos, folha e fluxo de caixa em dia, com relatórios que você entende.</small></span><svg class=\"ic ic-seta\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li class=\"rv\"><a href=\"/servicos/obrigacoes-trabalhistas/\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.3-5.5 6.5-5.5s5.7 1.9 6.5 5.5\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M16.5 14.6c2.6.1 4.3 1.8 5 4.9\"/></svg><span><b>Obrigações trabalhistas</b><small>Registro, folha, férias, 13º, rescisões, FGTS e INSS calculados e entregues no prazo.</small></span><svg class=\"ic ic-seta\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li class=\"rv\"><a href=\"/servicos/migrar-mei-para-me/\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 20h5v-5h5v-5h5V5h3\"/><path d=\"M15 5h6v6\"/></svg><span><b>Migrar de MEI para ME</b><small>Seu negócio cresceu. A gente faz a mudança para Microempresa no prazo certo e com o imposto planejado.</small></span><svg class=\"ic ic-seta\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li><li class=\"rv\"><a href=\"/planejamento-tributario/\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3v18M6 21h12M5 7h14\"/><path d=\"m5 7-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z\"/></svg><span><b>Planejamento tributário</b><small>Simulação entre Simples, Presumido e Real para pagar só o imposto que a lei exige.</small></span><svg class=\"ic ic-seta\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></li></ul>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "ctaPost": "<section class=\"cta-faixa\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-tit\">\n  <svg class=\"linha cta-linha rola\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path class=\"linha-sombra\" d=\"M0 170C140 150 250 64 380 60C510 56 560 128 700 128C860 128 1010 42 1200 22\" pathLength=\"1\"/><path class=\"linha-traco\" d=\"M0 170C140 150 250 64 380 60C510 56 560 128 700 128C860 128 1010 42 1200 22\" pathLength=\"1\"/></svg>\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-in rv\">\n    <h2 id=\"cta-tit\">Vamos colocar sua empresa em dia?</h2>\n    <p>Fale com um especialista da Contelb. A gente escuta, entende o seu caso e mostra o caminho.</p>\n    <div class=\"acoes\"><a class=\"btn btn-claro\" href=\"https://wa.me/556130229700?text=XMSGX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-evento=\"whatsapp\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20.5 11.8a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-12.6 7.4L3.5 20.5l1.4-4.2a8.5 8.5 0 1 1 15.6-4.5z\"/><path d=\"M9 8.6c.2-.5.5-.6.9-.6h.5c.2 0 .4.1.5.4l.7 1.7c.1.3 0 .5-.1.7l-.5.6c.6 1.2 1.6 2.2 2.8 2.8l.6-.5c.2-.2.5-.2.7-.1l1.7.7c.3.1.4.3.4.5v.5c0 .4-.2.7-.6.9-.7.4-1.6.5-2.5.2-2.4-.8-4.3-2.7-5.1-5.1-.3-.9-.2-1.8.1-2.4z\"/></svg><span>Falar com especialista</span></a><a class=\"btn btn-contorno-claro\" href=\"tel:+556130229700\" data-evento=\"telefone\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 3.5h3.5l1.7 4.3-2.2 1.4a11 11 0 0 0 6.8 6.8l1.4-2.2 4.3 1.7V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A17 17 0 0 1 3 5.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"/></svg><span>(61) 3022-9700</span></a></div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
